title: "Our Enemies Monitor"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  Evidence-based OSINT knowledge base on foreign interference, hybrid threats,
  geopolitical pressure, and strategic dependencies affecting Europe.
  Published as a public projection with explicit evidence levels (E1-E5) and
  editorial review status.
